})();</script></div></div></div><div class="KLEmSd"></div><div data-encoded-docid="KVurMYlzm-R1IvkVAAAAAA==" data-implicit-notification-eligible="false" data-result-index="0" data-title="Marketing Data Analyst - India" role="group" jscontroller="leJiCf" jsdata="ZSBYQe;_;_dL6aq2JJemK4-EPja6woQc62 xQKg9c;_;_dL6aq2JJemK4-EPja6woQc64" jsaction="rcuQ6b:npT2md"><div><div class="XFOJCe"><h2 class="HKvozf IFnjPb">Job description</h2><span jsname="QAWWu" class="OOyDTc">Position Overview: We&#39;re looking for a data-driven, strategic Marketing Analyst to join our high-impact team. In this role, you&#39;ll transform complex data into actionable insights that drive marketing performance, revenue growth, and customer value. You&#39;ll work at the intersection of marketing analytics, MarTech, and sales alignment, using tools like Power BI, SQL, Oracle Eloqua, and Forrester&#39;s B2</span><span jsname="pqRzIf">...</span><span jsname="ij8cu" class="ejCXj" id="tsuid__dL6aq2JJemK4-EPja6woQc_181" aria-live="polite" style="display:none">B Revenue Waterfall™ to shape our go-to-market strategy. Key Responsibilities: Analyze large, complex datasets using SQL to uncover trends and opportunities. Build and maintain interactive dashboards and data visualizations in Power BI. Track and optimize marketing KPIs, functional metrics, and impact metrics. Apply Forrester&#39;s B2B Revenue Waterfall™ to align marketing and sales around buying groups. Leverage web analytics and customer journey analytics to improve digital marketing performance. Use Oracle, Snowflake, and Alteryx for data management and automation. Collaborate cross-functionally with sales, operations, and product teams to drive data-informed decisions. Optimize processes and workflows using marketing technology (MarTech) tools like Segment CDP and Twilio Engage. Qualifications: Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, Statistics, or a related field (Master&#39;s preferred). 5+ years of experience in marketing analytics, revenue marketing, or a related field. Proficiency in SQL, Excel, and Power BI. Experience with Alteryx or similar data automation tools. Strong understanding of B2B marketing and revenue alignment frameworks. Familiarity with Oracle Eloqua, Segment, Twilio Engage, and Snowflake. Excellent communication skills with the ability to present complex data clearly to stakeholders. Soft Skills: Strategic Thinking – You see the big picture and connect data to business outcomes. Cross-Functional Collaboration – You work seamlessly with teams across the organization. Stakeholder Engagement – You influence decisions at all levels with data-backed insights. Process Optimization – You streamline workflows for efficiency and scalability. Adaptability – You thrive in fast-paced, evolving environments. Attention to Detail – You ensure accuracy in every analysis and report. Project Management – You juggle multiple priorities and deliver on time. Disclaimer: Please note that, due to the current integration framework, this opportunity is currently available exclusively to employees of Altair and DISW. While there is a possibility that the position may be made available to all Siemens employees through a future external posting, this is not guaranteed. We appreciate your understanding and cooperation during this transitional period. This communication does not constitute a promise or guarantee of future employment opportunities beyond the current scope. Why us? Working at Siemens Software means flexibility - Choosing between working at home and the office at other times is the norm here. We offer great benefits and rewards, as you&#39;d expect from a world leader in industrial software. A collection of over 377,000 minds building the future, one day at a time in over 200 countries. We&#39;re dedicated to equality, and we welcome applications that reflect the diversity of the communities we work in. All employment decisions at Siemens are based on qualifications, merit, and business need. Bring your curiosity and creativity and help us shape tomorrow! Siemens Software. Transform the Everyday #LI-PLM #LI-HYBRID. Requirements: name: Siemens. location: Pune, IN. experience: 5 - 10 years. Primary Skills: Alteryx, Collaborate, Marketing, Oracle, Power BI, Project Management, SQL, Segment, Snowflake, Statistics, Twilio, analytics, automation, collection, communication, communication skills, dashboards, data, data management, data visualizations, datasets, integration, interactive, market strategy, marketing, operations, performance, sales, scalability, workflows</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid__dL6aq2JJemK4-EPja6woQc_181" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCUQPQ" data-ved="2ahUKEwjt-9ivnIyYAxVpxTgGHQ0XLHQQl5ACegQIJRA9"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwjt-9ivnIyYAxVpxTgGHQ0XLHQQ5ZkFegQIJRA-"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwjt-9ivnIyYAxVpxTgGHQ0XLHQQyo8CegQIJRA_"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name:&#39;Siemens&#39;,job_title:&#39;Marketing Data Analyst - India&#39;})","__dL6aq2JJemK4-EPja6woQc_189",null,13,null,null,null,null,null,5025273,"horizon_jobs",[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["share_link","https://www.google.com/search?q\u003dData+An