eliable, production-grade data solutions that support analytics, AI/ML, operational reporting, and downstream integrations.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThe Data Engineer works handson with SAP systems, Salesforce CRM, Pricing and Quoting platform, MES platforms, middleware/integration tools, and cloud data platforms, ensuring enterprise data is trustworthy, accessible, and compliant.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Responsibilities\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Data Pipeline Engineering \u0026 Integration\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003eDesign, implement, and maintain batch and near–real-time data pipelines from:\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSAP ECC / S/4HANA (IDocs, extractors, CDS views, APIs),Salesforce CRM, Pricing and quoting platform, Multiple MES systems , External and third-party data sources\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eImplement ETL/ELT pipelines using enterprise-approved tools and cloud services\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eEnsure reliable orchestration, monitoring, error handling, and recovery of data flows\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eOptimize performance, scalability, and cost efficiency of data ingestion processes\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Enterprise Data Platform Development\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuild And Operate Enterprise Data Platforms Such As\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eCloud data warehouses / data lakes MS Azure and SAP Business Data Cloud or related data product,SAP BW / analytics backends,\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImplement Data Models (raw, Curated, Semantic Layers) Aligned With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eEnterprise canonical models\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eBusiness domains (Sales, Finance, Operations, Manufacturing, Supply Chain)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eEnable analytics, reporting, AI/ML, and self-service BI use cases\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Data Quality, Reliability \u0026 Observability\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003eImplement data quality controls, validation rules, reconciliation checks, and alerts. Monitor data freshness, completeness, accuracy, and consistency\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSupport root cause analysis for data issues across source systems and pipelines\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eEnsure SLAs are met for business-critical datasets\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Data Governance \u0026 Security Implementation\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003eEnforce data governance standards defined by the Enterprise Data Architect, including:\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eData ownership and stewardship models,Master data alignment (customer, product, pricing, supplier)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eMetadata, lineage, and documentation standards\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImplement Security, Privacy, And Compliance Controls\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eRole-based access control (RBAC),Data masking and encryption,GDPR and regulatory requirements\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSupport audits and compliance assessments related to enterprise data\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Collaboration with Enterprise Architecture \u0026 Stakeholders\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWork Closely With The Enterprise Data Architect To\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eTranslate architecture blueprints into implementable solutions,Contribute to roadmap execution and platform evolution\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCollaborate With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eApplication teams (SAP, Salesforce, MES)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eIntegration teams (e.g., MuleSoft, SAP BTP Integration Suite)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eAnalytics, BI, and Data Science teams\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eBusiness stakeholders and process owners\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eProvide technical input to project design, demand intake, and solution reviews\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e DevOps, Automation \u0026 Best Practices\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApply DataOps And DevOps Practices\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eCI/CD for data pipelines\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eInfrastructure-as-code (IaC) where applicable\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eVersion control and automated testing\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eDocument pipelines, models, and operational procedures\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eContinuously improve reliability, performance, and maintainability\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEducation\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRequired Qualifications\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eBachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Engineering, or related field\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Skills \u0026 Experience\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eStrong hands-on experience in data engineering (typically 5–8+ years)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSolid Experience With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eSAP data sources (ECC/S4 tables, CDS views, extractors, APIs)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSalesforce data model and APIs\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eEnterprise integration platforms (e.g., MuleSoft, SAP BTP Integration Suite)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProficiency In\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eSQL (advanced)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003ePython, Spark, or equivalent data processing frameworks\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExperience With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eCloud data warehouses and data lakes\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eDimensional and domain-oriented data modeling\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eData quality and observability frameworks\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eDeveloping data ingest and semantic models within the data lake\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFamiliarity With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eManufacturing and MES data structures\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eERP, CRM, and pricing data domains\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eGovernance \u0026 Enterprise Skills\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eExperience implementing enterprise data governance rules (not just defining them)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eUnderstanding of master data concepts and cross-system alignment\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eAbility to work within enterprise architecture standards and reference models\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePreferred Qualifications\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eExperience in SAP-centered enterprises\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExposure To\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eAI/ML data enablement\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eStreaming platforms (e.g., Kafka, Event Hub)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSAP Datasphere, BW/4HANA, or SAC integrations\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eKnowledge of FinOps / cost optimization for data platforms\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eExperience working in global, multi-region environments\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat Can We Offer You For Your Talent\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eVishay offers a comprehensive suite of benefit programs including health care coverage, financial support programs and other resources designed to help you achieve your personal and professional goals. With us, you'll experience unique career paths, an open and collaborative culture, a stable business that will be there for you, and opportunities to work globally and locally.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eDo you have the skills we need Are you ready to power your career as you power the world If so, apply today.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eVishay be committed to a workplace free of harassment and unlawful discrimination. We do not engage in discrimination or harassment based on sex, race, color, religion, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, age, or any other characteristic protected by law in hiring and employment practices.","Engineer Data Engineering \u0026 Analytics",null,null,0,[["organization","Vishay Intertechnology, Inc."],["organization_mid","/m/03p3gr5"],["publisher_name","Foundit"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bc2bf2e67461101:0x828d43bf9d9ee343"],["cluster_id","0x0deb7771f8b44b6b"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"_dL6aq2JJemK4-EPja6woQc65":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[15113200,0.054252185,4]]],"_dL6aq2JJemK4-EPja6woQc76":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Pune+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003deZh-Vl5PHM2f4PzFAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_zWLMQoCQQxFsfUIVqksRHZVsFEQBEUsBCvbJQ5hZmRMlkmE3c47eBHP5EkcC5sP__He8D0YbvbsIxNl2KEh_F9kD2PYMqbeolP4PF9wkysoYXYBhOEg4hON1sGs1VVdq6bKq2HRKyf3Wpiu0tUl0t80GjBTm9CoWSxnXdWyn8wvseAejmyUjVxgSeL7aQGugshwfjBN4YSlRQ2W8QuceEb4swAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAoxDtEohMeFScHKOcXUnRFZ0JQDy_jumKYELq-r0qFYA5Q\u0026source\u003dsh/x/job/uv/m5/1#fpstate\u003dtldetail\u0026htivrt\u003djobs\u0026htidocid\u003deZh-Vl5PHM2f4PzFAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026htiq\u003dData+Analyst+in+Pune+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs",null,null,"Engineer Data Engineering \u0026 Analytics",null,null,null,null,1,null,37,["H4sIAAAAAAAA_zWLMQoCQQxFsfUIVqksRHZVsFEQBEUsBCvbJQ5h